  "vetSays": [
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "🛡️ Javier, Susan, Donna, Min and Alessio met them at the door — 5 put down. Min, Alessio are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 37,
      "line": "🛡️ Javier, Alessio, Naran, Catalina and Nino met them at the door — 5 put down. Javier, Alessio, Naran, Catalina, Nino are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 39,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 51,
      "line": "🛡️ Susan, Donna, Naran, Nino and Sofia met them at the door — 3 put down, 1 driven off. Donna didn't come back. Naran, Nino, Sofia are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 59,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Sofia just put down The Terms of Service... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 59,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Victor just put down The Callback... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 59,
      "line": "🛡️ Susan, Naran, Nino, Sofia and Victor met them at the door — 4 put down, 1 driven off. Susan, Nino, Sofia, Victor are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 62,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Catalina just put down Chorus Line... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 62,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 62,
      "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said NOTHING. Forget the higher-ups.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 62,
      "line": "◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn ho"
    },
    {
      "day": 63,
      "line": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a LEGEND, sweetheart. More STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread — and look the Mirror Draft in the eye. The producers are WAITING.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 64,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Naran just put down Ugly-Eyes... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 126,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Katarina just put down The Ugly Beast... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 126,
      "line": "🛡️ Hugo, Katarina and Aki met them at the door — 1 put down, 2 barely walked away. Hugo, Katarina, Aki are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 138,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Nikos just put down The Algorithm... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 144,
      "line": "📺 \"You've gotten too big for the story. Ratings are GREAT, by the way — but you're threatening the narrative now. So the narrative is fighting back. Meet the PRODUCERS.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 145,
      "line": "📻 The producers name it: the Nielsen. Ratings embodied. It fights boring — and the crowd adores it for that."
    },
    {
      "day": 148,
      "line": "🛡️ Nikos met them at the door — 1 put down."
    }
  ],
